      en: ["Built in the 1st century AD during the early Roman Empire.", "The theater could accommodate between 4,000 and 5,000 people.", "Major archaeological excavations were conducted in 1930.", "Reopened as a performance space in 2023 after extensive renovation.", "Much of its original stone was used to build the Venetian fortress in 1630.", "It is one of the few Roman theaters in Croatia integrated into a natural slope."],
